@startuml
title COMP-SEQ07 UC07 关注关系组件顺序图
autonumber
actor 用户 as U
participant "用户主页" as UI
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "用户管理" as USER
participant "关注关系管理" as REL
participant "通知管理" as NOTIFY
U -> UI: 选择关系操作
UI -> GW: POST /users/{id}/relationship
GW -> USER: validateUsers(currentId, targetId)
USER --> GW: 有效/无效
alt 用户有效且不是本人
  GW -> REL: changeRelation(command)
  REL --> GW: 最新关系状态/幂等结果
  opt 新关注或特别关注
    REL -> NOTIFY: subscribeContent(currentId, targetId)
    NOTIFY --> REL: subscriptionCreated
  end
end
GW --> UI: 操作结果
UI --> U: 刷新关系状态
@enduml
